    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "MLBO4",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -110,
      "name": "Provenance",
      "fill": "#475569",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1440,
      "content": "ChartWarden NEW design baseline (live capture). Tokens read from the running web app (apps/web index.css, :root and .dark) on 2026-10-22; screens captured at 1440 px as the seeded Administrator. This is a frozen reference of the implemented new design (primary #1a56eb, Inter, cool-white canvas), not an independently authored mockup: it can detect drift from today, not drift from design intent. Supersedes the Lantern frames (primary #3b45a8, Fraunces) for colour and type.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
